{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4598cec5f095116a","name":"Orbital Defense Mines","source":{"id":"source:reference-4598cec5f095116a","title":"Orbital Defense Mines","revision":21401,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:44:18Z","sha256":"de2237b4906d83a3857b756da3e68d9fbb251628a4bf4d00262bb1998b7a8bc8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21401","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Orbital%20Defense%20Mines&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4598cec5f095116a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["These nearly invisible satellites spring to life as a ship approaches, moving rapidly toward the vessel and detonating once they get close."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The people of ",{"tag":"a","children":["O'reen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/O%27reen","referenceId":"reference:218e3e8c43c9574a"}," take the defense of their world very seriously. Despite this fact, there are many strange and powerful races throughout ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"}," that have technology that is unfamiliar to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["O'reenians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/O%27reenians"},", making it difficult for them to sense threats from the outside until it is too late. As a result, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["O'reenians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/O%27reenians"}," have created a network of Orbital Defense Mines that detect, move toward, and attack any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," approaching ",{"tag":"a","children":["O'reen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/O%27reen","referenceId":"reference:218e3e8c43c9574a"}," without proper transponder identifiers. Whenever the heroes approach ",{"tag":"a","children":["O'reen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/O%27reen","referenceId":"reference:218e3e8c43c9574a"}," for the first time, they may encounter Orbital Defense Mines.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Orbital Defense Mines Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Artificial"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Artificial"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," attempts to enter ",{"tag":"a","children":["O'reen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/O%27reen","referenceId":"reference:218e3e8c43c9574a"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +10 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d10x2 (Half Damage on Miss)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," Each Round on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative Count"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative_Count"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," +8) for 5 Rounds\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," (DC 16):"]}," As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", the Starship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check to reduce the damage caused by an exploding Orbital Defense Mine. If the check is successful, the damage taken by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," is reduced by half (if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," is already taking half damage from the attack, it instead takes one-quarter damage)."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," (DC 16):"]}," The character can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check to detect the presence of the mines. Furthermore, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", the character can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," skill to use the Starship's sensors to detect the mines, granting the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," a +2 dodge bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against the mines' attacks."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," This Hazard assumes that the triggering ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," is passing through the thick net of security satellites surrounding the whole planet. You can also choose to have the orbital defense mines only cover certain squares; in such a case, the mines trigger when a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," enters the square of, or a square adjacent to, an Orbital Defense Mine, and there is no recurrence.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
